Android ringtones bundled with Desktop Calls
============================================

Atria.ogg, Ganymede.ogg, Luna.ogg, Oberon.ogg, Triton.ogg and Umbriel.ogg in
this folder are Android's ringtones of those names, from the Android Open
Source Project, unchanged. Desktop Calls builds them into its binary and
offers them in its Ringer Window, under "Android".

